  {
   "type": "pub-columns",
   "title": null,
   "texts": [
    "pub-column",
    "厨具、餐具和木制储物箱摆放在深色墙壁前的金属开放式储物单元上。",
    "pub-image",
    "IMAGE",
    "MANUAL_INPUT",
    "s19284881"
   ],
   "images": [
